  "description": "Official implementation of BandPO: Bridging Trust Regions and Ratio Clipping via Probability-Aware Bounds for LLM Reinforcement Learning. BandPO replaces canonical clipping (PPO/GRPO) with dynamic bounds to resolve exploration bottlenecks and prevent entropy collapse.",
